WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[No sound] A dark ink background.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Four white approach lights appear in a row.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.500
A glideslope line comes in. The two right-hand lights turn amber: on slope.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.500
The lights settle on the baseline and the word glideslope appears beside them.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Glideslope. M&amp;A transition · Transformation. glideslopepartners.com

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The wordmark fades out.
